 "remarks": "Experience the Compo Beach lifestyle in this idyllic New England beach bungalow offering modern day amenities with seaside charm. Just nine doors from Compo Beach and deceiving in size from the outside, this lovely refuge is surprisingly spacious. Pairing multiple gathering spaces with high ceilings, hardwood floors and plentiful sunlight throughout. Key features include; a large, wood paneled Living room with skylights and a wood burning fireplace, an eat-in Kitchen with center island, vaulted ceilings, wet bar, transom windows and separate access to the rear yard, a Dining room that can comfortably seat 6, and 3 cozy bedrooms located towards the rear of the home. Outside amenities include a charming entertaining patio area, w/ outdoor shower and changing room along with an irrigation system and a detached 1 car garage. Potential tenants must have great credit and references. Tenants to be responsible for the yard and garden maintenance and to use Landlord's gardener. Pet may be considered on a case by case basis at LL's approval.",
